cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Stillwater Lift Bridge | Stillwater, Minnesota, USA"
abstract: >-
  A complete drone photogrammetry image set of the Stillwater Lift Bridge, a 1931 vertical-lift
  bridge over the St. Croix River, captured October 31, 2026 with a DJI FC9313 at native
  4096x3072 resolution as 34 waypoint missions: stacked rings around both lift towers, 21 orbits
  down the length of the bridge, two straight-down grids and six passes along its sides, flown on
  five batteries under overcast sky. 2,223 images, GPS intact on every frame, original aircraft
  filenames preserved, each image tagged with its mission; faces and license plates blurred in
  350. 2,222 of the 2,223 solve in one OpenDroneMap model using GPS-neighbor matching; camera poses for
  the original photos in COLMAP (FULL_OPENCV) and RealityScan XMP formats, 1.8 million tie points
  and the full ODM solve with its settings are included, in a metric frame from the photos' GPS.
  There is no physical scale reference.
authors:
